#AREA Medusa's Castle~
#AUTHORS Xak~




#HELPS
-1 'MEDUSA'S CASTLE'~
Medusa's Castle
---------------

This is where the hideous gorgon lies.  Myths tell of her power 
to turn men to stone with a single glance.  Tales also tell of
three blind witches who dwell nearby and delve into dark powers.

Last Revised on March 14, 1999 by

(a) Jaxom

{a}JAXOM
~
0 $~

#RANGES 50 70 1 99

#MOBILES
#11000
medusa~
Medusa~
The evil gorgon prepares for attack!~
You see a ugly woman with snakes for hair and glowing green eyes!~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_AGGRESSIVE|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_HUNT|AFF_TONGUES
-1000 S
64 BODY_HAND|BODY_FOOT BODY_MOUTH|BODY_EYE|BODY_HAND|BODY_FOOT 30d30+3000 1d1+46
126077 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
>fight_prog 20~
mpecho Medusa stares at you, but you turn your head just in time.
~
>fight_prog 20~
say You shall join my statue collection!  
cackle $n
~
>fight_prog 20~
cast 'faerie fire' $n
~
>fight_prog 70~
cast 'energy drain' $n
~
>fight_prog 65~
cast 'call lightning' $n
~
|
#11001
Blind Witch~
A Blind Witch~
An old hag is here.~
